Intellectual-property note
---------------------------
SpiceMeister translates SPICE models you have the right to use. It DETECTS and
REPORTS vendor encryption (`.PROTECT`, encrypted libraries, compiled Verilog-A /
OSDI); it does NOT circumvent it. The REA bridge is intended for characterising
binary model containers you are authorised to analyse for interoperability.
Respect the license terms of any vendor model you translate.
